title: Distribute operational expenses rewards in `pallet-staking-async`
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Another reward kind is added to `pallet-staking-async`.

      This reward is taken from the general pot, dedicated to the operational expenses 
      (`RewardKind::OperationalExpenses`). At era rotation, all the funds from this pot are
      moved to the other pot to be distributed among all the validators later. The distribution
      follows the era points performance and paid out in the `payout_stakers`. Unclaimed rewards
      are pruned after [`HistoryDepth`] eras and processed by the [`UnclaimedOperationalExpensesHandler`].

      Operational expenses reward currency may be different from the `Currency` and can be configured by 
      `OperationalExpencesCurrency` config item.
  - audience: Runtime User
    description: |
      Another reward kind is added to `pallet-staking-async`.

      This reward is taken from the general pot, dedicated to the operational expenses. 
      At era rotation, all the funds from this pot are moved to the other pot to be distributed 
      among all the validators later. The distribution follows the era points performance and 
      paid out in the `payout_stakers`.

      Operational expenses reward currency may be different from the currency used for the other
      reward types.
